### Get active return categories (LOGISTICS - used by the food collection recording screen)
GET {{baseApiPath}}/food-return-categories/active

### Get all return categories (SETTINGS - used by the settings screen)
GET {{baseApiPath}}/food-return-categories

### Create a return category (sortOrder is assigned by the backend, new categories go last)
POST {{baseApiPath}}/food-return-categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bananenkisten",
  "sortOrder": 0,
  "enabled": true
}

### Update a return category
PUT {{baseApiPath}}/food-return-categories/11
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 11,
  "name": "Graue Kisten",
  "sortOrder": 1,
  "enabled": true
}

### Reorder return categories (order of the ids becomes the new sortOrder)
POST {{baseApiPath}}/food-return-categories/reorder
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryIds": [
    12,
    11,
    13
  ]
}
